    <h2><a href="/en/news/2025092100">Main services unavailable</a></h2>
    <p class="date">Posted on Sunday 21 September 2025, at 16:10 UTC</p>
    <p>Our main services have been down since 2025-09-17 10:06 UTC due to a broken switch on operator side, we are waiting for updates.</p>
<p>As usual, e-mails are not lost: they are being collected by our MX2 service and will be released when our main services are up and running again.</p>

  </div>
  <div class="news">
    <h2><a href="/en/news/2024052400">Main services unavailable</a></h2>
    <p class="date">Posted on Friday 24 May 2024, at 18:21 UTC</p>
    <p>Our main services have been down since 2024-05-22 01:31 UTC, we don't know why yet and are waiting for on-site support.</p>
<p>As usual, e-mails are not lost: they are being collected by our MX2 service and will be released when our main services are up and running again.</p>

